{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06213","headline":"青龙寺昙壁上人院集 · 裴迪","name":"青龙寺昙壁上人院集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵境信爲绝，法堂出尘氛。\n自然成高致，向下看浮云。\n迤逦峯岫列，参差闾井分。\n林端远堞见，风末疎钟闻。\n吾师久禅寂，在世超人羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴迪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}